# An update of Spotify drops spicetify's patch; this puts it back for every
# user who has a spicetify config, as that user (spicetify refuses root).
# Installed by the installer's Spicetify step (scripts/install/apps/spicetify.sh).

[Trigger]
Operation = Install
Operation = Upgrade
Type = Package
Target = spotify

[Action]
Description = Re-applying spicetify to the updated Spotify...
When = PostTransaction
Exec = /usr/bin/sh -c 'for d in /home/*/.config/spicetify; do [ -e "$d" ] || continue; u=$(stat -c %U "$d"); h=$(getent passwd "$u" | cut -d: -f6); runuser -u "$u" -- env HOME="$h" spicetify backup apply -n -q || echo "spicetify: run spicetify backup apply as $u"; done; true'
